+amount, and date-constrained lookups remain graph-free and use canonical local
+records. Expansion prefers matching entity nodes over subject/thread text and
+does not traverse broad category/template hubs or non-seed high-degree shared
+domains/organizations. Assistant traces report whether graph expansion ran,
+its matched query terms, bounded candidate IDs/count, and graph provenance on
+selected evidence.
 
