+Retrieval readiness is separate from semantic coverage. A scope can be ready
+through deterministic lexical/sender/entity/template/thread fallbacks while
+semantic coverage is empty, partial, unavailable, rebuilding, or complete.
+Direct RAG records stable retrieval, reranking, selected/dropped evidence, and
+final-answer progress without widening the user's selected scope.
